+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+This project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification is required on all builds, including development builds. An earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification in development builds has been superseded: security consistency across build modes takes precedence over development convenience, so unverified certificates are not permitted in any configuration.
